      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">السَّمَائِمُ الأَوَاجِجُ</span></b>  [<i>The fiercely-burning hot
winds;</i> the latter word being pl. of ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">آجَّةٌ</span></b> , fem. of
